  "limitations": [
    "This mapping translates Project definitions and records only; CRM, Tasks, and Meetings retain independent Context ownership even when the configured Notion databases contain relations among them.",
    "Portable milestones remain embedded project work meaning and are not independently mapped to a Notion target.",
    "Project milestone checklist tags live in project page content rather than mapped database properties; this mapping does not expose them as projects.records.update fields.",
    "Project property updates expose only projectType and status through exact configured choice translation; name, relations, dates, page content, and structural changes are not update-scoped.",
    "Schema compatibility is not established by this declaration; an exact-lock private probe must observe current target schemas."
